From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Telesphoreo <me@telesphoreo.me>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:37:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Reject remote privileged packet targets

Require privileged editor and tag-query targets to be loaded and within 32 blocks. Also reject invalid test-instance dimensions and jigsaw depths before mutation, discard client-supplied execution state, and rate-limit abuse logging.

